What is measured: every selected question of the golden set (`{{.Body.Golden}}`)
is asked as a new conversation. The documents behind the streamed `sources`
(best chunk rank per document) are compared with the expected documents, the
answer's `[n]` markers are resolved to the documents they cite, and — with a
real LLM — the answer text is matched against the expected answer and its
variants.

